"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5468589827","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119867#issuecomment-5468589827","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119867","id":5468589827,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRfQPAw","user":{"login":"Image-unavailable","id":56268917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjY4OTE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56268917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable","html_url":"https://github.com/Image-unavailable","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-30T12:08:32Z","updated_at":"2026-08-30T12:08:32Z","body":"Rebased. I'm trying out a different way of managing my local branches, should make it easier to keep things in sync with master and #119705.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5468589827/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5569567782","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119867#issuecomment-5569567782","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119867","id":5569567782,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABS_jcJg","user":{"login":"Image-unavailable","id":56268917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjY4OTE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56268917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable","html_url":"https://github.com/Image-unavailable","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-07T10:56:02Z","updated_at":"2026-09-07T10:56:02Z","body":"Turns out the issues I was having with import preview shadows bugging out was because I was using my own builds that paired this PR with #115176. Shadows work fine when using either only ONE of this PR or #115176, but when paired together they bug out.\r\n\r\nAs this PR doesn't introduce issues on its own, seems to me like it's in a good enough state for me to pull it out of draft.\r\n\r\nIn the future I might look into #115176 some more and why it causes issues when paired with PR, but for now I'll put #115176 as draft since it has less benefits compared to this PR and is somewhat more contentious.\r\n\r\nAlso, squashed on top of #119705.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5569567782/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5781462031","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119867#issuecomment-5781462031","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119867","id":5781462031,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWJocDw","user":{"login":"Image-unavailable","id":56268917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjY4OTE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56268917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable","html_url":"https://github.com/Image-unavailable","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-22T18:03:30Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T18:03:30Z","body":"> There's a small but consistently reproducible performance improvement in all 3 projects (I've tested multiple runs). The performance benefit is likely more significant on slower GPUs, particularly mobile (I can test later if needed).\r\n\r\nIt also depends on shadowmap resolution, as I have already highlighted in my own mini-benchmark in the PR post.\r\n\r\nThe Godot Reflection project file you linked doesn't set a custom `lights_and_shadows/directional_shadow/size` value in its `project.godot` file, which means it's likely running at the default shadowmap resolution of 4096. I'd expect the changes be more impactful if setting the shadowmap resolution to something like 6144 or 8192.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5781462031/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5784014539","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119867#issuecomment-5784014539","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119867","id":5784014539,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWMEOyw","user":{"login":"Image-unavailable","id":56268917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjY4OTE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56268917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable","html_url":"https://github.com/Image-unavailable","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-22T20:55:19Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T20:55:19Z","body":"Also, shadow computation time is independent from screen resolution (though it is affected by aspect ratio), so testing at 4k screen resolution is going to show smaller deltas between master and PR than testing at 1080p, simply because rendering to screen will take a larger amount of time at 4k than at 1080p, while shadow computation time remains constant between the two.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5784014539/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5838119492","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119867#issuecomment-5838119492","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119867","id":5838119492,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABW_qiRA","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-25T19:11:02Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T19:11:35Z","body":"> Also, shadow computation time is independent from screen resolution (though it is affected by aspect ratio), so testing at 4k screen resolution is going to show smaller deltas between master and PR than testing at 1080p, simply because rendering to screen will take a larger amount of time at 4k than at 1080p, while shadow computation time remains constant between the two.\r\n\r\nMakes sense, here's godot-reflection on the same machine with all effects disabled (and no TAA) with 16384 directional shadow size:\r\n\r\n`master` | This PR\r\n-|-\r\n805 FPS (1.24 mspf) | 1090 FPS (0.91 mspf)\r\n\r\nAnd with 8192 shadow size:\r\n\r\n`master` | This PR\r\n-|-\r\n1344 FPS (0.74 mspf) | 1444 FPS (0.69 mspf)\r\n\r\nOut of curiosity, is a similar optimization possible for positional shadow drawing?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5838119492/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5845382769","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119867#issuecomment-5845382769","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119867","id":5845382769,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXGl2cQ","user":{"login":"Image-unavailable","id":56268917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjY4OTE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56268917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable","html_url":"https://github.com/Image-unavailable","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-26T10:13:02Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T19:25:47Z","body":"> Out of curiosity, is a similar optimization possible for positional shadow drawing?\r\n\r\nI would say no, since there's no shadowmap areas we can avoid drawing to by better controlling the draw rects:\r\n- for cubemap omnis, it's 6 square shadowmaps, so each pixel is needed to form the full cube\r\n- for dual-paraboloid omnis, it's 2 shadowmaps, and I similarly expect every pixel to be needed\r\n- for spotlights, there's one shadowmap, and it's already tightly fit around the spotlight's light circle, so it's already optimal in that regard; *theoretically* there could be some gain by cutting out shadowmap rendering outside of the spotlight circle, but that would need a different approach than this PR, since draw regions have to be axis-aligned rects\r\n\r\nThe last option, even if implemented, would probably require extra GPU work setting up the shadowmap masks (through copy or draw or whatever), so it wouldn't be as guaranteed a gain as this PR (which shrinks the draw rect at basically no cost on the CPU). Also I would expect the GPU to more efficiently discard pixels outside of the draw rect than simply \"masked\" pixels, since for the latter memory reads would still be needed.\r\n\r\nSo, no. Directional lights and spotlights still have pixels that can be skipped, but no more gains can be made through the approach from this PR. And the gains from skipping those pixels through other approaches are kind of a gray area.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5845382769/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]